---
import Figure from "../ProjectFigure.astro";
import Video from "../ProjectVideo.astro";
import Explorer from "../ProjectExplorer.astro";
import { buildingCases } from "../../data/lab-figures";
---
<section class="project-section" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Model the environment</p><h2 id="method-title">Method</h2><p>Connect a building’s geometry with activity and transmission.</p></div>
  <Figure id="twin-framework" />
  <ol class="method-steps"><li><h3>Represent the space</h3><p>Building geometry, ventilation, and room function.</p></li><li><h3>Describe activity</h3><p>Occupancy, movement, and environmental conditions.</p></li><li><h3>Model exposure</h3><p>Transport and transmission under a specified scenario.</p></li></ol>
</section>
<section class="project-section" id="room-risk" aria-labelledby="risk-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">At the scale of a room</p><h2 id="risk-title">Room-level risk</h2><p>Locate a room, understand the scenario, and communicate its risk category.</p></div>
  <div class="risk-layout"><div><Figure id="risk-workflow" /><Figure id="building-viewer" /></div><Figure id="risk-interface" /></div>
  <p class="scope-note">Archived interface examples. This room-level workflow models surface-mediated transmission; the opening animations illustrate indoor transport.</p>
</section>
<section class="project-section" id="building-cases" aria-labelledby="cases-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Different spaces, different connections</p><h2 id="cases-title">Building cases</h2><p>Explore the source layouts and their spatial networks.</p></div>
  <Explorer id="buildings" label="Choose a building case" choices={buildingCases.map(c => ({ id: c.id, title: c.title, description: c.description, figures: [`${c.id}-plan`, `${c.id}-network`] }))} />
</section>
<section class="project-section" id="demonstrations" aria-labelledby="demos-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Spatial understanding and action</p><h2 id="demos-title">Demonstrations</h2><p>Mapping and a simulated robotic response, shown as separate research examples.</p></div>
  <div class="paired"><Video id="indoor-mapping" /><Video id="disinfection-simulation" /></div>
</section>
